  shortDescription: Holds and protects every part and guides airflow.
  whatItDoes: The case has mounting points for the motherboard, drives and PSU, plus
    front-panel buttons and ports.
  keyFacts:
  - Supports ATX motherboards
  - Bottom PSU shroud
  - 'Front I/O: USB and audio'
  installationSteps:
  - Remove both side panels and store the screws.
  - Check pre-installed standoffs.
  - Lay the case on its side on a clear, non-carpeted table.
  safetyTip: Work on a hard surface and touch the bare metal frame to discharge static.
